{"questions":[{"id":"Q166-V5","typeId":"比例宣傳判讀","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S07:p2"],"variantOf":"Q166","variantIndex":5,"prompt":"濾網阻隔率定義為 (k−1)/k。k 從 100 升至 200，廠商說阻隔率變成 2 倍。下列哪一組判斷及兩次阻隔率完全正確？","answer":"不合理","explanation":"依公式兩次為 99%、199/2%；新率不等於舊率乘 2。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"text":"合理；原阻隔率 99%，新阻隔率 199/2%，所以變成 2 倍。","misconception":"百分比雖算對，但沒有核對兩者倍率。","id":"c1"},{"text":"不合理；原阻隔率 1%，新阻隔率 1/2%，變成一半。","misconception":"計算的是漏過率，不是阻隔率。","id":"c2"},{"text":"合理；原阻隔率 99%，新阻隔率 198%，確實加倍。","misconception":"直接把舊率乘 2，未用新 k 代入公式，且算出的阻隔率超過百分之百。","id":"c3"},{"text":"不合理；原阻隔率 99%，新阻隔率 199/2%，未變成 2 倍。","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q171-V1","typeId":"新運算定義","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S11:p2"],"variantOf":"Q171","variantIndex":1,"prompt":"定義 [a,b;c,d]＝ad−bc。若 [6,x;4,-3]＝-50，求 x。","answer":"8","explanation":"6×(-3)−4x＝-50，得 x＝8。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"6*(-3)-4*x=-50","root":"8","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"text":"8","id":"c1"},{"text":"16/3","misconception":"將 bc 中的 c 錯看為 a。","id":"c2"},{"text":"-8","misconception":"移項後漏除負係數的負號。","id":"c3"},{"text":"17","misconception":"把正數乘負數誤算成正數。","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q171-V2","typeId":"新運算定義","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S11:p2"],"variantOf":"Q171","variantIndex":2,"prompt":"定義 [a,b;c,d]＝ad−bc。若 [7,x;5,-4]＝-73，求 x。","answer":"9","explanation":"7×(-4)−5x＝-73，得 x＝9。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"7*(-4)-5*x=-73","root":"9","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"text":"45/7","misconception":"將 bc 中的 c 錯看為 a。","id":"c1"},{"text":"9","id":"c2"},{"text":"-9","misconception":"移項後漏除負係數的負號。","id":"c3"},{"text":"101/5","misconception":"把正數乘負數誤算成正數。","id":"c4"}],"b